<title>USA: Quizno's gets $2 mln loan.</title>
<headline>Quizno's gets $2 mln loan.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quizno's Corp, a franchiser of restaurants, said Friday it has received a $2 million loan from Retail &amp; Restaurant Growth Capital Inc.</p>
<p>Most of the proceeds are to be used to secure and develop Quizno's restaurants, President and Chief Executive Rick Schaden said in a statement. The company said that will be done either through a turnkey program or through the purchase of existing restaurants that could be converted into Quizno's units.</p>
<p>A portion of the proceeds will be used to retire certain debt and to provide working capital, it said.</p>
<p>As of December 31, there were 156 Quizno's restaurants in 25 states.</p>
</text>
